{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36291","headline":"陪李郎中夜[宴] · 方干","name":"陪李郎中夜[宴]","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"间世星郎夜[宴]时，丁丁寒漏滴声稀。\n琵琶弦促千般语，鹦鹉杯深四散飞。\n遍请玉容歌白雪，高烧红蜡照朱衣。\n人间有此荣华事，争遣渔翁恋钓矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}